section__
  @title "Dragonstone Blood Price at first light"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "medium"
  @backdrop "https://example.com/thrones/06-endgame-siege/frame-406.jpg"

  "Dragonstone's lower battery reeks of burned oil and wet slate. Sandor presents intercepted dispatches showing rival claimants planning simultaneous proclamations the moment your siege line slackens. Arya reports that courier edits already transformed yesterday's orders into calls for indiscriminate reprisals. The information war is now moving faster than your infantry.

If you respond in public law, you can reassert command unity and tie battlefield conduct to written limits. If you answer through covert retaliation, you may silence saboteurs before they spread and train every commander to fear hidden punishment more than policy. A third route buys external lift capacity and couriers, accelerating tempo while binding your regime to offshore obligations.

Lightning flashes across the bay and reveals ships loading in total silence. This is the hinge between siege command and succession command."

  choice__
    @target "Blackwater Bay Sealed Bargain beneath lion seals"
    @action honor = clampStat(honor + 1, 0, 30)
    @action war_readiness = clampStat(war_readiness + 2, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Promulgate a formal siege-command ordinance with witnessed penalties, prioritizing legitimacy over surprise."
  __choice

